{"1379880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RED MACHINA", "steam_appid": 1379880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/55546747107b3c3bb846c8689d50d7c5.poster.avif?t=1785584559\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/55546747107b3c3bb846c8689d50d7c5.webm?t=1785584559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/55546747107b3c3bb846c8689d50d7c5.mp4?t=1785584559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Red Machina</i></strong><i> is a virtual system created to fulfill the darkest desires of its players. X, the last player to access it, finds himself trapped in a plot of corruption, betrayal, and collapse.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disturbing Secrets Await You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/63b832b8881f4d00bcf9e50f8cdeb9e8.poster.avif?t=1785584559\" width=1078 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/63b832b8881f4d00bcf9e50f8cdeb9e8.webm?t=1785584559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/63b832b8881f4d00bcf9e50f8cdeb9e8.mp4?t=1785584559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore different maps, you will encounter unique stories and gameplay. Each character plays a key role in accomplishing your mission;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs feature multiple dialogue choices, allowing players to shape X’s personality as they wish— aggressive, passive, emotional, or chaotic;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro Visuals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/3cf50c01c85601aa3702caf13fa0b4a9.poster.avif?t=1785584559\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/3cf50c01c85601aa3702caf13fa0b4a9.webm?t=1785584559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/3cf50c01c85601aa3702caf13fa0b4a9.mp4?t=1785584559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resident Evil 1, Silent Hill, and Cosmology of Kyoto are the main inspirations for Red Machina’s graphics and visuals.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio faithful to PSX limitations;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertex lighting;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Textures inspired by the restrictions of the original PlayStation era;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/c0e7a2f86217974eced40b2ed9c770dd.poster.avif?t=1785584559\" width=1078 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/c0e7a2f86217974eced40b2ed9c770dd.webm?t=1785584559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph